WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.000
-Republicans have been
wallowing after yet another

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.667
string of defeats
in key battleground states

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:06.968
on Tuesday,
as the front runner

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:08.667
for their party's
presidential nomination,

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.667
Donald Trump, faced more
legal trouble,

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.834
with his daughter Ivanka
taking the stand

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.033
in their New York fraud trial.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:16.367
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.801
Donald Trump's daughter Ivanka

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:23.434
arrived at the Manhattan
courthouse today

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:24.601
and took the witness stand

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:26.701
in the Trump company's
civil fraud trial,

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:28.934
a scenario Trump was
reportedly desperate to avoid --

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:33.200
I'm assuming because Ivanka is,
in his eyes, the most competent

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.234
and thus most knowledgeable
member of the family.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.601
There's no way Trump trusted
his two bearded, oblong bozos

00:00:38.601 --> 00:00:40.701
with any real information,

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.133
but Ivanka
could get him in trouble.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.100
Because while Don Jr.
was in the woods

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.400
posing for the cover of his
country folk Christmas album,

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.667
and Eric was in Brazil
having his gums lowered,

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:53.767
I'm willing to bet Ivanka
was in the room for everything.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.367
For example,
maybe she could explain

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.200
what the hell her father
was talking about on Monday

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.267
when he pulled out a piece
of paper during his testimony

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.601
and said it would
clear his name.

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:16.834
So, on top of everything else,

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:21.100
Donald Trump has never seen
an episode of "Law &amp; Order."

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.767
"Your Honor, may I present
non-submitted evidence

00:01:23.767 --> 00:01:24.968
from the witness stand?"

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:26.200
"Do whatever you want.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.133
Courtrooms are famously
loose with the rules."

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:32.934
"In fact, if you -- if I ever
say anything you don't like,

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.868
feel free to object to me."

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:36.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.767
I'm honestly dying to know
what that document was

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:42.100
because it was no doubt
incredibly stupid.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.467
[As Trump] Your Honor,
I have in my possession

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:47.667
the fortune from a cookie

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:52.300
obtained last night
at Mr. Chang's on 58th Street.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:55.467
It reads as follows.
[ Clears throat ]

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.033
"What you believe,
you can make true."

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.934
I accept your apology.

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:02.834
I accept, and I believe
I'm free to go.

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:04.701
[Normal voice]
Honestly, I'm just shocked
Trump didn't pull out

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:06.634
some of the courtroom sketches
that have been released

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:08.067
so he could complain
about them.

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:10.200
Trump's former press secretary
called one particular sketch

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.267
of Trump "a travesty" and said
it looks nothing like him.

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:15.434
Now, I'll admit,
it doesn't look a ton...

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:19.601
It doesn't look a ton like Trump

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:22.100
until you widen out
and see the hands.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:26.133
They nailed the hands!

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:28.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:30.634
By the way, the same artist
who drew that sketch

00:02:30.634 --> 00:02:32.100
also did one of El Chapo.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:36.434
And yet somehow, a guy who
shares a courtroom sketch artist

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.167
with a notorious
drug kingpin

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:40.601
remains the GOP front-runner
for president.

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:41.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.267
In fact, recent polls suggest

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:45.000
he's in a dead heat
with Joe Biden.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.501
So Democrats
were steeling themselves

00:02:46.501 --> 00:02:47.968
for some big losses on Tuesday

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:50.767
in several key bellwether states
like Virginia.

00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:53.434
I know a clip package is coming,
so let's just get it over with.

00:02:53.434 --> 00:02:56.234
The polling is awful.
I'm sure Democrats got crushed.

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:58.367
Just hit me with the bad news
so I can go sulk.

00:02:58.367 --> 00:03:00.067
-Overnight, Democrats

00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:02.067
celebrating
a series of key victories.

00:03:02.067 --> 00:03:05.067
-Big wins for Democrats
and for abortion rights.

00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:08.334
-In Ohio, voters have decided
overwhelmingly to make abortion

00:03:08.334 --> 00:03:10.534
a right
under the state constitution.

00:03:10.534 --> 00:03:12.334
In Virginia, CNN projects

00:03:12.334 --> 00:03:14.234
Democrats will gain full control

00:03:14.234 --> 00:03:15.601
of the state legislature.

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:17.133
-Meanwhile, in Kentucky,

00:03:17.133 --> 00:03:19.033
it was Democratic
Governor Andy Beshear

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:22.033
defeating the state's
Republican attorney general,

00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:23.901
Daniel Cameron,
who had been backed

00:03:23.901 --> 00:03:25.868
by former
President Donald Trump.

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:28.667
-Well, allow me to quote
the great Edward R. Murrow

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:31.434
and say, "What the [bleep]
is going on?"

00:03:31.434 --> 00:03:34.100
You're telling me Biden is
losing to Trump in the polls,

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.667
but a Democrat
just won reelection

00:03:35.667 --> 00:03:37.834
against a Trump-backed candidate
in Kentucky?

00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:40.601
You're telling me Trump, the guy
who stocked the Supreme Court

00:03:40.601 --> 00:03:43.534
with '80s movie villains
with the explicit goal

00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:46.634
of overturning Roe v Wade,
is leading the polls in Ohio,

00:03:46.634 --> 00:03:49.167
where voters
just overwhelmingly approved

00:03:49.167 --> 00:03:51.367
a ballot measure
to protect abortion rights?

00:03:51.367 --> 00:03:53.834
This [bleep]
makes so little sense,

00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:57.501
even Steve Kornacki's big board
last night said, "I give up."

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:58.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:01.133
One thing's for sure --
standing up for abortion rights

00:04:01.133 --> 00:04:03.267
and bodily autonomy
wins elections.

00:04:03.267 --> 00:04:05.334
Voters are clearly furious
about losing Roe,

00:04:05.334 --> 00:04:08.534
and in even supposedly red
states like Kentucky and Ohio,

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:10.000
they've been turning out
in large numbers

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.367
to protect
reproductive rights.

00:04:11.367 --> 00:04:14.601
Ohio is the seventh state
to enshrine abortion rights

00:04:14.601 --> 00:04:16.701
through a ballot initiative
since Roe was overturned,

00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:18.734
and that includes battleground
states like Michigan

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:21.400
and even deep red states
like Kansas.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.167
Abortion was also very much
on the ballot in Virginia,

00:04:24.167 --> 00:04:26.100
where the Republican governor,
Glenn Youngkin,

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.534
was hoping to win full control
of the state legislature

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.400
so he could pass
a 15-week abortion ban.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:33.167
Although you might not know that

00:04:33.167 --> 00:04:35.667
from this Fox News interview
he did on Election Day.

00:04:35.667 --> 00:04:36.968
-Welcome to Virginia.

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:38.300
It's Election Day,

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:42.100
and we are going to hold
our House and flip our Senate.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.567
-Ever since the Supreme Court
overturned Roe v Wade,

00:04:45.567 --> 00:04:48.367
Republicans have lost
most of those elections.

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:49.701
How is today going
to be different?

00:04:49.701 --> 00:04:51.334
-Well, let me just begin
with the fact

00:04:51.334 --> 00:04:54.000
that the biggest issue across
the Commonwealth of Virginia --

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.467
I hear it every day.

00:04:55.467 --> 00:04:57.734
We've had 100 campaign stops.

00:04:57.734 --> 00:04:58.968
I hear it every day.

00:04:58.968 --> 00:05:01.167
...is inflation and jobs

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:04.667
and concerns about what Biden
is doing to our economy.

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:07.400
-It's so telling that these guys
spent 50 years laser-focused

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.601
on their number-one goal
of overturning abortion rights,

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:11.067
and then as soon
as they do it,

00:05:11.067 --> 00:05:12.801
not only do
they not brag about it,

00:05:12.801 --> 00:05:14.901
they'd rather talk about
literally anything else.

00:05:14.901 --> 00:05:16.300
"So, what's your position
on abortion?"

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.467
"Well, I think first of all,
we have to talk about jobs."

00:05:18.467 --> 00:05:19.801
"My question
was about abortion."

00:05:19.801 --> 00:05:21.501
"Then, of course, we need
to talk about inflation."

00:05:21.501 --> 00:05:23.234
"Okay. But what about abortion?"
"And then, of course,

00:05:23.234 --> 00:05:25.400
what we really need to focus on
is Hunter Biden's laptop."

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.334
"I'm asking about abortion."
"And I will get to that.

00:05:27.334 --> 00:05:30.200
But first, what do you think
of my shiny red vest?"

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.367
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.367 --> 00:05:34.200
I stole it off
a Carnival cruise.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.968
It was also evident in the way
they were coping last night

00:05:36.968 --> 00:05:38.467
that Republicans
are having a hard time

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:41.200
coming to terms with the fact
that their position on abortion

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.234
is deeply unpopular
with the majority of voters.

00:05:43.234 --> 00:05:46.434
Here's Fox host Sean Hannity
trying to wrap his brain

00:05:46.434 --> 00:05:48.834
around why the issue
keeps hurting Republicans.

00:05:48.834 --> 00:05:51.834
-Democrats are trying to scare
women into thinking Republicans

00:05:51.834 --> 00:05:54.901
don't want abortion legal
under any circumstances.

00:05:54.901 --> 00:05:57.234
-First of all, if Democrats
were trying to scare people,

00:05:57.234 --> 00:05:59.901
they would just show them
this courtroom sketch.

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:02.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.801 --> 00:06:06.701
But yeah, I wonder where voters

00:06:06.701 --> 00:06:08.367
could possibly
have gotten the notion

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:10.267
that Republicans want
to outlaw abortion,

00:06:10.267 --> 00:06:12.033
aside from
all the GOP-led states

00:06:12.033 --> 00:06:13.501
that have outlawed abortion,

00:06:13.501 --> 00:06:15.734
or the GOP politicians who say
they want to outlaw abortion,

00:06:15.734 --> 00:06:16.968
or the new
Speaker of the House

00:06:16.968 --> 00:06:18.701
who sponsored a bill
to outlaw abortion

00:06:18.701 --> 00:06:20.834
and who's so conservative --
and this is real --

00:06:20.834 --> 00:06:24.234
he said last year that he
and his 17-year-old son monitor

00:06:24.234 --> 00:06:26.267
each other's porn intake.

00:06:26.267 --> 00:06:28.534
That's real.
He said that.

00:06:28.534 --> 00:06:29.968
They apparently use an app

00:06:29.968 --> 00:06:33.167
that sends each other a report
when they look at porn,

00:06:33.167 --> 00:06:34.801
so they can hold
each other accountable.

00:06:34.801 --> 00:06:36.300
Can you imagine knowing --

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.634
in real time --

00:06:38.634 --> 00:06:42.834
when your dad
is watching porn?

00:06:42.834 --> 00:06:44.767
The only thing I want to hear
from my dad

00:06:44.767 --> 00:06:47.601
on the phone is, "Hold on.
Your mother wants to say hi."

00:06:47.601 --> 00:06:49.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.601
Also, how can you, sir,
use an app to monitor porn

00:06:52.601 --> 00:06:55.501
when your name sounds
like a porn actor's name?

00:06:55.501 --> 00:06:57.501
For example, the other day
I wanted to learn more

00:06:57.501 --> 00:06:58.968
about his extreme
right-wing positions,

00:06:58.968 --> 00:07:01.133
so I googled the words
"Johnson exposed."

00:07:01.133 --> 00:07:02.467
And let's just say

00:07:02.467 --> 00:07:05.300
the notifications
on the porn monitoring app

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.801
my dad made me install

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:08.601
were blowing up.

00:07:08.601 --> 00:07:09.934
He called me right away,
and I said

00:07:09.934 --> 00:07:11.534
I was working on "A Closer
Look," and then he said,

00:07:11.534 --> 00:07:13.701
"You should take a closer look
at your priorities."

00:07:13.701 --> 00:07:15.534
[ Laughter ]

00:07:15.534 --> 00:07:19.000
Although it is fun to imagine
what it would have been like

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.000
if Joe Biden had that app on his
phone with his son Hunter.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.567
Just mid press conference,

00:07:24.567 --> 00:07:26.767
"Hold on a second.
My phone is buzzing."

00:07:26.767 --> 00:07:29.434
[ Notifications chiming ]
Uh...Oh.

00:07:29.434 --> 00:07:32.100
Ohh, dear God, Hunter.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.934
Dear God, Hunter,
get a hold of yourself, man.

00:07:37.133 --> 00:07:38.734
[ Laughter ]

00:07:38.734 --> 00:07:41.067
Keep it on the laptop, buddy.

00:07:41.067 --> 00:07:43.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.934 --> 00:07:45.367
Anyway, where was --
Oh, yeah.

00:07:45.367 --> 00:07:46.968
So, Republicans
were wallowing last night.

00:07:46.968 --> 00:07:49.434
In fact, they were so bummed
that over on Newsmax,

00:07:49.434 --> 00:07:51.267
former GOP senator
and presidential candidate

00:07:51.267 --> 00:07:52.934
Rick Santorum was complaining
about the fact

00:07:52.934 --> 00:07:54.934
that Democrats
sponsored ballot initiatives

00:07:54.934 --> 00:07:57.667
to legalize marijuana
and enshrine abortion rights.

00:07:57.667 --> 00:08:00.400
-We've seen this now
for the last several years.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:04.834
And so a base election,
they, Democrats outspend,

00:08:04.834 --> 00:08:08.067
and you put very sexy things
like abortion

00:08:08.067 --> 00:08:09.701
and marijuana
on the ballot,

00:08:09.701 --> 00:08:11.300
and a lot of young people
come out and vote.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.834
-Ooh là là.

00:08:12.834 --> 00:08:14.334
[ Laughter ]

00:08:14.334 --> 00:08:16.534
Abortion and marijuana
are sexy now?

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:18.033
That's so weird to hear

00:08:18.033 --> 00:08:21.033
coming from international
sex symbol Rick Santorum.

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.968
You think marijuana is sexy?

00:08:23.968 --> 00:08:26.300
Look, by the time
Ohio is cool with anything,

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:28.400
it's not sexy anymore.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.133
Marijuana is for 50-year-olds
at a Dead &amp; Company concert.

00:08:32.133 --> 00:08:35.701
Marijuana is so tame compared to
what teens are into these days.

00:08:35.701 --> 00:08:36.934
If Rick Santorum ever watched

00:08:36.934 --> 00:08:38.501
so much as five minutes
of "Euphoria,"

00:08:38.501 --> 00:08:40.934
he'd come out looking like
Rudy Giuliani.

00:08:40.934 --> 00:08:42.467
I mean, that's what
I look like after

00:08:42.467 --> 00:08:44.501
I watch one episode
of "Euphoria."

00:08:44.501 --> 00:08:46.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.834
[As Giuliani] Is this
what teens are really like?!

00:08:48.834 --> 00:08:50.367
[Normal voice] What's clear
is that the GOP's various

00:08:50.367 --> 00:08:52.234
culture war obsessions
and hostility to democracy

00:08:52.234 --> 00:08:53.501
are turning off voters.

00:08:53.501 --> 00:08:55.000
That doesn't mean Democrats
should feel comfortable.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.667
Trump, as we've said before,
can still easily win,

00:08:57.667 --> 00:08:59.334
unless, you know,
he ends up in jail,

00:08:59.334 --> 00:09:00.734
which I have to say
would be...

00:09:00.734 --> 00:09:02.033
-Very sexy.

00:09:02.033 --> 00:09:03.033
[ Laughter ]

00:09:03.033 --> 00:09:04.534
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:04.534 --> 00:09:06.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:08.167 --> 00:09:09.934
Hey, everybody. Thanks for
watching "A Closer Look."

00:09:09.934 --> 00:09:11.934
And as a reminder,
my brother Josh and I

00:09:11.934 --> 00:09:13.601
have started a new podcast

00:09:13.601 --> 00:09:16.400
called "Family Trips
with the Meyers Brothers."

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.133
We hope you listen,
we hope you like it,

00:09:18.133 --> 00:09:19.467
and see you soon.

